    // never parks. Each time this thread itself was off the CPU between two polls (a 20 us sleep that took 2 ms or more) the
    // deadline moves by that time, since the thread that has to park was probably off it too; the total is capped at ten
    // times the wait. A thread that never parks is still abandoned (a little later on a loaded machine).
    val started = __ablaRuntimeHostStwMilliseconds()
